.Dd November 18, 2026
.Dt GPART 1
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm gpart
.Nd show GPT partitions
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Cm show
.Op Ar block:0
.Sh DESCRIPTION
Reads the geometry and GPT partition records from the
.Dq block:
scheme and prints the start sector, size, index and name for every partition.
A device or protocol error exits non-zero and no table is invented.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr lsblk 1 ,
.Xr newfs 1 ,
.Xr gpart 8
